Subject: [PATCH] imx95-frdm: avoid invalid GPIO request without board revision
Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [embedded specific]

Raven reserves ADC1 for M7, so A55 U-Boot cannot use it to identify the
FRDM board revision. Skip revision-dependent external power control when
the revision is unavailable. Otherwise ext_pwr_desc is uninitialized and
dm_gpio_request dereferences a null device pointer.

--- a/board/nxp/imx95_frdm/imx95_frdm.c
+++ b/board/nxp/imx95_frdm/imx95_frdm.c
@@ -210,4 +210,9 @@ static void setup_typec(void)
 		/* Enable EXT PWR */
 		ret = get_board_version(rev, data);
+		if (ret) {
+			printf("%s: board revision unavailable; skip EXT PWR setup\n",
+			       __func__);
+			return;
+		}
 		if (ret == 0) {
 			if (rev[0] < 2) {
